---
layout: base.njk
seoTitle: "Raffiuddin Mohammed · QA Lead, Project Manager, Scrum Master & Delivery Lead · London"
description: "Raffiuddin Mohammed, London: delivery lead, project manager, Scrum Master and QA lead. Getting web, iOS and Android software released, with test automation that proves it works."
---

<section class="hero hero-cv">
  <div class="glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="hero-grid" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="cv-top">
    <div class="hi-text">
      <h1>Hi, I'm {{ site.shortName }}.<br><span class="grad sweep">I get software delivered, and prove it works.</span></h1>
      <ul class="role-chips" aria-label="Roles">
        {% for r in cv.roles %}<li class="rc{{ loop.index }}">{{ r }}</li>{% endfor %}
      </ul>
      <div class="platforms" aria-label="Platforms I deliver on">
        <span class="pf-label">Ships on</span>
        <span class="pf pf-web"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M3 12h18M12 3c2.5 2.7 3.8 5.7 3.8 9s-1.3 6.3-3.8 9c-2.5-2.7-3.8-5.7-3.8-9S9.5 5.7 12 3z"/></svg>Web</span>
        <span class="pf pf-ios"><svg class="brand-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12.152 6.896c-.948 0-2.415-1.078-3.96-1.04-2.04.027-3.91 1.183-4.961 3.014-2.117 3.675-.546 9.103 1.519 12.09 1.013 1.454 2.208 3.09 3.792 3.039 1.52-.065 2.09-.987 3.935-.987 1.831 0 2.35.987 3.96.948 1.637-.026 2.676-1.48 3.676-2.948 1.156-1.688 1.636-3.325 1.662-3.415-.039-.013-3.182-1.221-3.22-4.857-.026-3.04 2.48-4.494 2.597-4.559-1.429-2.09-3.623-2.324-4.39-2.376-2-.156-3.675 1.09-4.61 1.09zM15.53 3.83c.843-1.012 1.4-2.427 1.245-3.83-1.207.052-2.662.805-3.532 1.818-.78.896-1.454 2.338-1.273 3.714 1.338.104 2.715-.688 3.559-1.701"/></svg>iOS</span>
        <span class="pf pf-and"><svg class="brand-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M18.4395 5.5586c-.675 1.1664-1.352 2.3318-2.0274 3.498-.0366-.0155-.0742-.0286-.1113-.043-1.8249-.6957-3.484-.8-4.42-.787-1.8551.0185-3.3544.4643-4.2597.8203-.084.0332-.1653.0667-.2441.1016L5.3203 5.5745a.6466.6466 0 0 0-.8984-.2383.6455.6455 0 0 0-.2324.8867l1.9941 3.4434C2.7283 11.4805 1.7012 14.3233 1.5 16.7891h21c-.2012-2.4658-1.2283-5.3086-4.6836-7.123l1.9922-3.4434a.6455.6455 0 0 0-.2324-.8867.6466.6466 0 0 0-.8984.2383l-.0383.0039zM6.9805 12.832a.8711.8711 0 0 1 .873.873.8711.8711 0 0 1-.873.8711.8711.8711 0 0 1-.871-.871.8711.8711 0 0 1 .871-.873zm10.039 0a.8711.8711 0 0 1 .871.873.8711.8711 0 0 1-.871.8711.8711.8711 0 0 1-.873-.871.8711.8711 0 0 1 .873-.873z"/></svg>Android</span>
      </div>
      <p class="lede">I run releases from ticket to production, and built the test automation that checks every one of them: on a schedule, across staging and production, with results in Slack before anyone asks.</p>
      <div class="actions">
        {% if site.email %}<button type="button" class="btn primary" data-email-open aria-haspopup="dialog">Talk to me <span class="arr" aria-hidden="true">→</span></button>{% endif %}
        <a class="btn" href="/delivery/">See how I deliver</a>
        <a class="btn" href="/projects/">My projects</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="demo-mini hero-card" data-demo="mini">
      <div class="dm-phone">{% include "demo-phone.njk" %}</div>
      <div class="dm-copy">
        <div class="eyebrow"><span class="dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>Featured project · QA automation</div>
        <h2>Watch a test run itself</h2>
        <p class="muted">An automated test signs in, shops and checks out, with nobody touching the phone.</p>
        <div class="term-pane small"><div class="pane-head"><span class="dots"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>Terminal</div><div class="term-body"></div></div>
        <div class="actions">
          <button type="button" class="btn primary" data-act="voice" aria-pressed="false" hidden>🔊 Play with commentary</button>
          <a class="btn" href="/automation/">Full test run <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<script src="/assets/automation-demo.js" defer></script>

<section id="hire">
  <h2>What you can hire me for</h2>
  <div class="grid three">
    <a class="card tint-1 reveal role-card" href="/delivery/">
      <span class="icon" aria-hidden="true">🚀</span>
      <h3>Delivery lead · Release manager</h3>
      <p class="muted">An Agile release process teams actually follow: pull request, staging, QA, production, with a clear owner and a clear gate at every step.</p>
      <span class="go">See the delivery flow →</span>
    </a>
    <a class="card tint-2 reveal role-card" href="/delivery/#who">
      <span class="icon" aria-hidden="true">🧭</span>
      <h3>Project manager · Scrum Master</h3>
      <p class="muted">Sprints planned and run in Jira or YouTrack, specs and release notes kept in Confluence, tickets and acceptance criteria written so developers can build them, blockers chased, and everyone knowing what ships next.</p>
      <span class="go">Who does what →</span>
    </a>
    <a class="card tint-3 reveal role-card" href="/projects/">
      <span class="icon" aria-hidden="true">✅</span>
      <h3>QA lead · Test automation</h3>
      <p class="muted">Test strategy plus Playwright and Appium suites for web, Android and iOS that run on a schedule in CI and report to Slack, so bugs are caught before users see them.</p>
      <span class="go">See the projects →</span>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="experience">
  <h2>Experience</h2>
  <ol class="timeline">
    {% for job in cv.experience %}
    <li class="reveal">
      <div class="tl-head">
        <h3>{{ job.role }}{% if job.draft %} <span class="draft-badge">Draft</span>{% endif %}</h3>
        <span class="tl-meta">{% if job.logos %}<span class="co-logos">{% for l in job.logos %}{% if l.text %}<span class="co-logo mono" role="img" aria-label="{{ l.alt }}">{{ l.text }}</span>{% else %}<img class="co-logo{% if l.square %} sq{% endif %}" src="{{ l.src }}" alt="{{ l.alt }}" loading="lazy" decoding="async">{% endif %}{% endfor %}</span>{% endif %}{% if job.url %}<a class="co-link" href="{{ job.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="{{ job.org }} website (opens in a new tab)">{% endif %}<b>{{ job.org }}</b>{% if job.url %}<span class="ext" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>{% endif %} · {{ job.dates }}{% if job.place %} · {{ job.place }}{% endif %}</span>
      </div>
      {% if job.points and job.points.length %}<ul>{% for p in job.points %}<li>{{ p }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul>{% endif %}
    </li>
    {% endfor %}
    {% if cv.earlier %}<li class="reveal tl-earlier"><div class="tl-head"><h3>Earlier career</h3></div><p class="muted">{{ cv.earlier }}</p>{% if cv.earlierLogos %}<span class="co-logos earlier">{% for l in cv.earlierLogos %}<img class="co-logo{% if l.square %} sq{% endif %}" src="{{ l.src }}" alt="{{ l.alt }}" loading="lazy" decoding="async">{% endfor %}</span>{% endif %}</li>{% endif %}
  </ol>
</section>

{% if cv.testimonials and cv.testimonials.length %}
<section id="testimonials">
  <h2>What people I've worked with say</h2>
  <div class="grid two">
    {% for t in cv.testimonials %}
    <figure class="card quote reveal tint-{{ (loop.index0 % 4) + 1 }}">
      <blockquote>“{{ t.quote }}”</blockquote>
      <figcaption><b>{{ t.name }}</b>{% if t.title %} · {{ t.title }}{% endif %}{% if t.source %} · <span class="muted">{{ t.source }}</span>{% endif %}</figcaption>
    </figure>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
{% endif %}

<section>
  <a class="card side-project reveal" href="/dashboards/">
    <div>
      <div class="eyebrow"><span class="pulse" aria-hidden="true"></span>Side project · {{ site.dataBrand }}</div>
      <h3>Live dashboards that run themselves</h3>
      <p class="muted">Markets, outages and the news on a 3D globe, collected and published automatically. The same automation, pointed at live data.</p>
    </div>
    <span class="go">Open {{ site.dataBrand }} →</span>
  </a>
</section>

<section class="home-cta card tint-2 reveal" id="talk">
  <h2>Talk to me</h2>
  <p class="muted">Hiring a QA lead, project manager, Scrum Master or delivery lead in London or remote? Or got a project that needs shipping? Pitch me the idea and let's have a chat.</p>
  <div class="actions">
    {% if site.email %}<button type="button" class="btn primary" data-email-open aria-haspopup="dialog">✉️ Email me</button>{% endif %}
    {% if site.linkedin %}<a class="btn" href="{{ site.linkedin }}" rel="noopener" target="_blank">LinkedIn</a>{% endif %}
  </div>
</section>
